  "notes": [
   [
    {
     "text": "Selected for a one-week artistic residency at Etnia House of Arts in Venice, Italy, Tóna Fritsdóttir developed a new art piece exploring Faroese culture, heritage, and identity. The residency took place within the historic Chiesa dell’Abbazia della Misericordia, the former church that now houses Etnia House of Arts, providing a dedicated space for artistic research, experimentation, and the development of the work in collaboration with the organisation."
    }
